==Description==
The [[:Category:Tier_2_Pets|Tier 2]] version of {{PetTooltip|pet_name=Shadow Stalker}}. Increases offline production. Charges non-shard spells. While [[Idle Mode]] is off, increases profits with time spent in Idle Mode.

Gains [[Experience#Pet Experience|experience]] each second, more if Idle Mode is off. Doesn't gain experience offline.

== Pet Abilities ==

Charges all non-shard spells by 2% every 5 seconds.

Multiplies Offline production by:
<br><math>L^{1.35} \times P \times 1.5 + 1</math>


While Idle mode is Off, multiplies profits by:
<br><math>\left( \log_{10}(T \times 0.5 + 1) + 1 \right)^{2.5} \times P^{0.5} + 1</math>


where:
* <math>L = \text{Pet Level}</math>
* <math>P = \text{Pet Ability Power}</math>
* <math>T = \text{Idle Time this Exile, in Hours}</math>

== Experience Gain ==
Gains experience each second, equal to:
<br><math>(2 + F) \times M \times I</math>

where:
* <math>I = 5 \iff \text{Idle Mode Off}\  \and\  I = 1 \iff \text{Idle Mode On}</math>
* <math>F = \text{Fixed Pet XP Bonus}</math>
* <math>M = \text{Pet XP Multiplier}</math>

